{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52369","headline":"回波乐 十二 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不语谛观如来，逍遥独脱尘埃。\n合眼任心树下，跏趺端坐花台。\n不惧前後二际，岂着水火三灾。\n只劝（陈谓「只」字衍，任谓「劝」字衍）遣荣乐[静]（靖）坐，莫恋妻子钱财。\n称体宝衣三事，等（任录作「葬」）身锡杖一枚。\n常持智[慧]（惠）刀剑，逢者眼目即开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52369.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52369","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}